@1 = ~Mia asked us to find her a pet after we promised to get her one. A friendly stray cat may be exactly what she wanted.~
@2 = ~Mia has her cat, Mr. Pumpkin, and gave us a strange coin she found near the Hall of Wonders.~
@3 = ~No, little one. We are destroyers of evil who kick butts of the bad guys and save the world for little things like you to be safe.~
@4 = ~Of course, little girl. You can pet Boo all you want. He likes when you scratch his tummy, like that.~
@5 = ~This isn't just any hamster. This is a miniature giant space hamster, out of this world. They are intelligent and have courageous hearts.~
@6 = ~I must disappoint you, Boo is not for sale. He is my faithful companion and a friend in cause toward greater good. He must remain at my side, little girl. However, if you want we can find you a different companion. Right, <CHARNAME>?~
@7 = ~Ehm… yeah. Yeah, sure.~
@8 = ~If we have time.~
@9 = ~We don't really have time for that.~
@10 = ~Hi.~
@11 = ~Hey, Mia? Look what we got you!~
@12 = ~Cat? By Helm, I love cats! Allesia surely won't mind. She is too nice. Tilda will be sooo jealous. I will call you Mr. Pumpkin. I wish I could give you anything worthwhile, but all I can give you is this strange coin I found near Hall of Wonders. It's pretty but Allesia says it's rubbish.~
@13 = ~Is that a hamster? By Helm, I always wanted a hamster. Can I pet him?~
@14 = ~Hihi. He's so cute.~
@15 = ~Really? I want one! I want one!~
@16 = ~Hi. Are you here to adopt me?~
@17 = ~No. We are just checking this place out.~
@18 = ~Hi. Are you here to adopt me?~
@19 = ~Hello. No. You're Mia? We want to ask you about scary person you've seen. Could you tell us about it?~
@20 = ~No. We are just checking this place out.~
@21 = ~You're ghost hunters? Like in the stories?~
@22 = ~Yay! Awesome! I can't wait!~
@23 = ~Yay! Awesome! I can't wait!~
@24 = ~It's okay if you don't. Maybe once I get adopted I will have a pet.~
@25 = ~I wish I could finally get adopted. Allesia and other kids are nice but this ghost... he is awful. It's a scary-looking man. Elderly man. He has a long, white beard and speaks funny. He was standing in the corner of the room last time, a couple nights ago. Please, make him go away. I'm scared to sleep.~
@26 = ~Don't worry. We'll do our best.~
@27 = ~We'll think about it.~
